        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Heading Out to the Highway\", Point of Entry, Hero, Hero\n- People: Judas Priest\n- Companies: Gull Records\n- Topics: heavy metal, albums, songs, compilation albums\n\nFacts:\n- Judas Priest released the album Point of Entry on 26 February 1981.\n- Point of Entry is the seventh album by the British heavy metal band Judas Priest.\n- Gull Records released Hero, Hero, a compilation album of early Judas Priest recordings, between British Steel (1980) and Point of Entry (1981).\n- \"Heading Out to the Highway\" is a song by the British heavy metal band Judas Priest from their 1981 album Point of Entry.",
